 colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\" style=\"border: 1px solid black;\">public</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\" style=\"border: 1px solid black;\">bool</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\" style=\"border: 1px solid black;\">36</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\" style=\"border: 1px solid black;\">Is the saved search public and available for everyone to use?</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\" style=\"border: 1px solid black;\">relatedTo</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\" style=\"border: 1px solid black;\">varchar</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\" style=\"border: 1px solid black;\">15</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\" style=\"border: 1px solid black;\">The module for which this saved search was created</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\" style=\"border: 1px solid black;\">query</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\" style=\"border: 1px solid black;\">text</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\" style=\"border: 1px solid black;\"><br></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\" style=\"border: 1px solid black;\">The query of the search</td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>','7507b9455a38-fbbf-ed31-0951f330aa7f'),('578901926307-84b0-0d87-9e52ba148efa','test','2022-08-25 06:14:47','2022-08-25 06:14:47','275981a36239-69ed-f5a3-e558076d74b3','Rana Nouman','275981a36239-69ed-f5a3-e558076d74b3','Rana Nouman',0,'published',0,1,'397','<ul>\n<li>1</li>\n</ul>\n',NULL),('5a18a8b9583c-b7cd-29ed-84bdf7de428c','Test 5','2016-11-28 02:43:38','2016-11-28 02:43:38','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>Test 5</p>','a86956c9583c-b7cd-29ed-8d8291c6c288'),('5aab6a22585d-200a-2253-7649420c0776','Test 11','2016-12-23 12:00:26','2016-12-23 12:00:26','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>Test 11</p>','a607e2215835-b8f6-bf45-62703a8a48f8'),('608f11535968-e7b9-5769-c798cf781f06','Test Code','2017-07-14 03:26:40','2017-07-14 03:26:40','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'645','<pre class=\"ql-syntax\" spellcheck=\"false\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">/**\nï»¿ * This is the code block with real time editingï»¿ï»¿\n */</span>ï»¿\n\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">&lt;?php</span>\n  $var = <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"test\"</span>;\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-class\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> </span>{\n       $first_name;\n\n        <span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title\">getFirstName</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">()</span></span>{\n            <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">$this</span>-&gt;first_name;\n        }\n  }\n\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">?&gt;</span>ï»¿\n</pre>',NULL),('61436b425837-a569-1d53-8acc206e1971','Mass income','2016-11-24 10:16:01','2016-11-24 10:16:01','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,0,'1','<p>Hah!! you are dreaming right!</p>',NULL),('63c159615836-0762-3836-2f156000fbe3','Project','2016-11-23 21:28:03','2016-11-23 21:28:03','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<h1>Project</h1><p><br></p><p>This is the project entity.</p>','a607e2215835-b8f6-bf45-62703a8a48f8'),('68ee04b05a38-4b68-32a1-4baeaf1c208d','Home','2017-12-18 12:09:12','2017-12-18 12:09:12','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'22a2c5915a35-9c67-ae8f-ea2fd3c4e50a','<p style=\"text-align: center; \"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"logo.png\" style=\"width: 67.0156px; float: none; height: 67.0156px;\" class=\"\"><u><br></u></p><h3><u>Introduction</u></h3><p><br></p><p>Prometheus is an open source project management and team collaboration software which is designed to give even the large enterprise project management tools a run for their money. The reason to have this a separate tool is because it packs its own feature set and is quite independent of the Phalcon based Gaia\' backend system.</p><p><br></p><h3><u>Technology Stack</u></h3><p>Prometheus is based on EmberJS using EmberCLI and AdminLTE with bootstrap and jQuery for the front end.</p><p><br></p><h3><u>Features</u></h3><ol><li>Project Management</li><li>Chat</li><li>Issue Management</li><li>Dashboard with virtual assistance</li><li>Conversations</li><li>Reports</li><li>WIki based documentation</li><li>Kanban style project board</li><li>Calandar</li></ol><p><br></p><h3><u>License</u></h3><p>Like Gaia it is distributed under AGLPv3 with mandatory attribution clause.</p><p><br></p>',NULL),('6e5855a6585c-ea05-1ae6-7dfc1212efe8','Issues','2016-12-22 11:41:34','2016-12-22 11:41:34','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>This page is used to define the issues entity in the system.</p><p><br></p><p>Issues are used to track the data of the tasks in the system.</p><p><br></p><p>If only we had the ability to add tables</p>','a607e2215835-b8f6-bf45-62703a8a48f8'),('6fa185f2583c-b7cd-29ed-22c63cb96a98','Node Package','2016-11-28 02:43:59','2016-11-28 02:43:59','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>The node declaration.</p><p><br></p><pre class=\"ql-syntax\" spellcheck=\"false\">{\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"name\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"prometheus\"</span>,\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"version\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"0.0.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"description\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"The web application of projects4me\"</span>,\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"private\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>,\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"directories\"</span>: {\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"doc\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"doc\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"test\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"tests\"</span>\n&nbsp;},\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"scripts\"</span>: {\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"build\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ember build\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"start\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ember server\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"test\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ember test\"</span>\n&nbsp;},\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"repository\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"\"</span>,\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"engines\"</span>: {\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"node\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"&gt;= 0.10.0\"</span>\n&nbsp;},\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"author\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"\"</span>,\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"license\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"AGPL\"</span>,\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"devDependencies\"</span>: {\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"broccoli-asset-rev\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^2.4.2\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-ajax\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^2.0.1\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-cli\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^2.8.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-cli-app-version\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^1.0.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-cli-babel\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^5.1.6\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-cli-dependency-checker\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^1.2.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-cli-htmlbars\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^1.1.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-cli-htmlbars-inline-precompile\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^0.3.1\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-cli-inject-live-reload\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^1.4.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-cli-jshint\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^1.0.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-cli-lodash\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^1.0.1\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-cli-qunit\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^2.1.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-cli-release\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^0.2.9\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-cli-sri\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^2.1.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-cli-test-loader\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^1.1.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-cli-uglify\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^1.2.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-websockets\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"5.0.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"mock-socket\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"5.0.1\"</span>\n&nbsp;},\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"dependencies\"</span>: {\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-data\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^2.8.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-disable-proxy-controllers\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^1.0.1\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-dynamic-component\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"0.0.4\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-export-application-global\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^1.0.5\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-i18n\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"4.2.2\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-load-initializers\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^0.5.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"ember-resolver\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^2.0.3\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"yuidoc-lucid-theme\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"0.1.2\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"loader.js\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^4.0.1\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"broccoli-sass\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^0.7.0\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"express\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^4.10.2\"</span>,\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-attr\">\"socket.io\"</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"^1.4.6\"</span>\n&nbsp;}\n}\n</pre>',NULL),('7507b9455a38-fbbf-ed31-0951f330aa7f','Models','2017-12-18 12:13:41','2017-12-18 12:13:41','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'22a2c5915a35-9c67-ae8f-ea2fd3c4e50a','<p>We have following models in the system</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL),('79be2d815aee-9787-4779-35bb2c04b35a','Models','2018-05-06 12:39:21','2018-05-06 12:39:21','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729','<p>We have the following models in the system</p><p><br></p><ol><li>Project</li><li>Issue</li></ol><p><br></p><p>Data models are subject to change without any prior notice.</p><p><br></p>',NULL),('80be76c7583c-b7cd-29ed-8413dd2cf43b','Index Route','2016-11-28 02:44:16','2016-11-28 02:44:16','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>This is the index route</p><p><br></p><pre class=\"ql-syntax\" spellcheck=\"false\">import Ember from <span class=\"hljs-string\">\"ember\"</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/**\n  The module route, it is loaded when a user tried to navigate to the route\n  :projectId e.g. acme.projects4.me/app/wiki/1\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-doctag\">@class</span> app.wiki.project.index\n  <span class=\"hljs-doctag\">@extends</span> Ember.Route\n*/</span>\nexport <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> Ember.Route.extend({\n\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/**\n&nbsp;&nbsp;The current project\n\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-doctag\">@property</span> project\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-doctag\">@private</span>\n&nbsp;*/</span>\n&nbsp;project: {},\n\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-comment\">/**\n&nbsp;&nbsp;The setup controller function that will be called every time the user visits the route, this function is responsible for loading the required data for the route\n\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-doctag\">@method</span> setupController\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-doctag\">@param</span> controller {Object} the controller object for this route\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-doctag\">@private</span>\n&nbsp;*/</span>\n&nbsp;setupController:<span class=\"hljs-function\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(controller)</span></span>{\n\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">var</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">self</span> = this;\n&nbsp;&nbsp;this.project = this.store.findRecord(<span class=\"hljs-string\">\'project\'</span>,params.projectId,{rels:<span class=\"hljs-string\">\'none\'</span>});\n&nbsp;&nbsp;controller.set(<span class=\"hljs-string\">\'project\'</span>,this.project);\n&nbsp;}\n});\n</pre>','927c1692583c-7785-29ed-eb7494f80f86'),('8487e3a3583c-7785-29ed-b5767999f6aa','Test1','2016-11-28 02:40:04','2016-11-28 02:40:04','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>Test1</p>',NULL),('861240365aee-61a1-21ed-86a22d10f326','Home','2018-05-06 08:27:50','2022-03-10 12:04:45','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729','<p>Prometheus is the client user interface</p>',NULL),('866d1ec35a92-3750-cc62-92e1a54955bf','Home','2018-02-25 05:52:06','2018-02-25 05:52:06','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1002','<p>Home</p>',NULL),('8c92ae63583c-b7cd-29ed-daa7ac056303','Test 9a','2016-11-28 02:44:28','2016-11-28 02:44:28','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>Test 9</p>','b4a59ab6583c-b7cd-29ed-04a99d097430'),('8e856825585c-328c-d95e-c39f95b51278','Test 8','2016-12-22 12:03:26','2016-12-22 12:03:26','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>Test 8</p>','a607e2215835-b8f6-bf45-62703a8a48f8'),('927c1692583c-7785-29ed-eb7494f80f86','Routes','2016-11-28 02:40:18','2016-11-28 02:40:18','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>These are all the routes in the system</p>',NULL),('9313db495a40-e700-b248-41442dc22785','Rohan','2017-12-24 12:44:03','2017-12-24 12:44:03','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'886','<p>This is <b>Rohan</b> <span class=\"atwho-inserted\" data-atwho-at-query=\"#\" contenteditable=\"false\"><a href=\"/app/886/issues/285\" class=\"in_progress\">#276 - magna, malesuada vel,</a></span>&nbsp; <span class=\"atwho-inserted\" data-atwho-at-query=\"@\" contenteditable=\"false\"><a href=\"/app/users/1\" class=\"undefined\">@Hammad Hassan</a></span>&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><th>Tagged</th><th><br></th></tr><tr><td>Hello</td><td>Phayan</td></tr><tr><td><br></td><td><br></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL),('94919b695837-a569-1d53-2c74ea9149d6','Surely this time','2016-11-24 10:16:52','2016-11-24 10:16:52','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>Surely this time it would work</p>',NULL),('97298942583c-b7cd-29ed-8caf59985a33','Introduction1','2016-11-28 02:44:39','2016-11-28 02:44:39','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',1,1,'1','<p class=\"ql-align-center\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"\n    height: 100px;\n    width: 100px;\n\"></p><h1>Introduction</h1><p><br></p><p>This is a test page that is designed in order to test the editor</p><p><br></p><h2><u>Text Formatting</u></h2><p><br></p><p>The editor must support basic capabilities of text formatting</p><ol><li><strong>Bold</strong></li><li><em>Italic</em></li><li><u>Underline</u></li><li><s>Strike through</s></li><li><a href=\"http://google.con\" target=\"_blank\">Link</a></li><li>Sub <sub>script</sub></li><li>Super <sup>script</sup></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 153, 0);\">Font color</span></li><li><span style=\"background-color: rgb(240, 102, 102); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Highlight color</span></li><li>Font <span class=\"ql-size-large\">Size</span></li></ol><p><br></p><h2><u>Code Block</u></h2><p><br></p><pre spellcheck=\"false\">This is a code block\n</pre><p><br></p><h2><u>Quoted Text</u></h2><p><br></p><blockquote>This is quoted Text</blockquote><p><br></p><h2><u>Font</u></h2><p><br></p><p>This is <span class=\"ql-font-serif\">different</span> font</p><p><br></p><h2><u>Indenting</u></h2><p><br></p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">Forward Indenting</p><p><br></p><p>Backward Indenting</p><p><br></p><h2><u>Text Alignment</u></h2><p><br></p><p class=\"ql-align-center\">This is center aligned</p><p>This is left aligned</p><p class=\"ql-align-right\">This is right aligned</p><p class=\"ql-align-right\"><br></p><h2><u>Image</u></h2><p><br></p><p><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></p>','1'),('9a66c014583c-7785-29ed-0561da427f13','Apache Config','2016-11-28 02:40:26','2016-11-28 02:40:26','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>Basic config for Gaia.</p><p><br></p><pre class=\"ql-syntax\" spellcheck=\"false\"><span class=\"hljs-section\">&lt;IfModule mod_rewrite.c&gt;</span>\n	<span class=\"hljs-attribute\"><span class=\"hljs-nomarkup\">RewriteEngine</span></span> <span class=\"hljs-literal\">on</span>\n	<span class=\"hljs-attribute\"><span class=\"hljs-nomarkup\">RewriteRule</span></span>&nbsp;^$ public/&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-meta\">&nbsp;[L]</span>\n	<span class=\"hljs-attribute\"><span class=\"hljs-nomarkup\">RewriteRule</span></span>&nbsp;(.*) public/<span class=\"hljs-number\">$1</span><span class=\"hljs-meta\"> [L]</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-section\">&lt;/IfModule&gt;</span>\n</pre>',NULL),('9bb64cd5585c-f3eb-5273-257dc1155df4','Test 6','2016-12-22 11:59:23','2016-12-22 11:59:23','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>Test 6</p>','a607e2215835-b8f6-bf45-62703a8a48f8'),('9f0f3499583c-b7cd-29ed-e7d33cea8166','Test Parent Update','2016-11-28 02:44:47','2016-11-28 02:44:47','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>Test 12</p>',NULL),('a0d97a865a92-dd3a-4cb7-2668701c8cb1','Home','2018-02-25 03:44:32','2018-02-25 03:44:32','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'342','<p><b>A Foundation is always a foundation</b></p><p><br></p><h1><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\">Period!</span></h1>',NULL),('a607e2215835-b8f6-bf45-62703a8a48f8','Entities','2016-11-23 09:57:58','2016-11-23 09:57:58','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<h1><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Entities</span></h1><p>This is the list of all the entities in the system that we are going to use.</p><p><br></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Projects</span></h2><p>	Projects obviously are the most basic unit in this project, everything in the system even the ACL and Navigation menu is tied to projects.</p><p><br></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Banner</span></h2><p>	A banner is a banner, it cannot be anything else and it should not be anything more or else.</p><p><br></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">System</span></h2><p>	A system is composition of units which are designed to represent a system. So if a system = a and unit = b and units = c then as per the Pythagoras theorem if a = b and b = c then a = c. This basically means that a system is after all a system </p><p><br></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Test</span></h2><p>	A test is what is used in order to verify the working of a system as per the intention it was designed for.</p><p><br></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">Alpha Maniac</span></h2><p>	A you make a really awesome and super cool system but it is one that is absolutely nuts is called alpha maniac.</p>',''),('a72723035a92-7c33-4cb7-cb62e157098f','Another A Pafe','2018-02-25 03:57:27','2018-02-25 03:57:27','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'342','<p>Not everything has to start with an A</p>',NULL),('a86956c9583c-b7cd-29ed-8d8291c6c288','Detail','2016-11-28 02:44:56','2016-11-28 02:44:56','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>Detail View</p><p><br></p><pre class=\"ql-syntax\" spellcheck=\"false\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"view detail-view\"</span>&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;{{action-menu definition=metaData.buttons onSave=\"onSave\"}}\n\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>{{module}} : {{model.name}}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h3</span>&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;{{#<span class=\"hljs-name\">each-in</span> metaData.sections as |section sections|}}\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"panel panel-primary\"</span>&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"panel-heading\"</span>&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{{t sections.label}}\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"panel-body\"</span>&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"row\"</span>&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{{#<span class=\"hljs-name\">each-in</span> sections.fields as |field definition|}}\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{{field-view view=\'detail\' definition=definition model=model module=module}}\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{{/<span class=\"hljs-name\">each-in</span>}}\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;{{/<span class=\"hljs-name\">each-in</span>}}\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n</pre><p><br></p><p><br></p><pre class=\"ql-syntax\" spellcheck=\"false\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">ul</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"people_list\"</span>&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;{{#<span class=\"hljs-name\">each</span> people}}\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>&gt;</span>{{this}}<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;{{/<span class=\"hljs-name\">each</span>}}\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">ul</span>&gt;</span>\n</pre>','21844680583c-b7cd-29ed-f0fac6d6ca7e'),('a8c8cc22595c-9e1e-f1fe-01db466b5167','Data Implementation','2017-07-05 01:39:04','2017-07-05 01:39:04','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'645','<p>This is the data implementation part</p>',NULL),('acd6178362a8-0b93-33c6-76b7d2ea72d2','Test','2022-06-14 10:53:32','2022-06-14 10:59:57','275981a36239-69ed-f5a3-e558076d74b3','Rana Nouman','275981a36239-69ed-f5a3-e558076d74b3','Rana Nouman',0,'published',0,1,'471','<p>r</p>\n',NULL),('ad616cc6585c-328c-d95e-984875c4a079','Test 9','2016-12-22 12:03:57','2016-12-22 12:03:57','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>Test 9</p>','a607e2215835-b8f6-bf45-62703a8a48f8'),('b3f3e4785aee-5ab3-dcc5-8345935d20c9','Issue','2018-05-06 12:53:07','2018-05-06 12:53:07','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'add12ff55acb-1902-6b9c-30d5411f7729','<h2>Issue</h2><p>Issues are used to maintain all the actionable tasks for a project.</p><p><br></p><h3>Fields</h3><p><br></p><table class=\"table table-bordered\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Length</th><th>Comment</th></tr><tr><td>issueNumber</td><td>Int</td><td>36</td><td>This is the field that is used to identify an issue</td></tr><tr><td>subject</td><td>String</td><td>100</td><td>The subject of the issue</td></tr><tr><td>description</td><td>Text</td><td><br></td><td>The description&nbsp;of the field</td></tr><tr><td>startDate</td><td>date</td><td><br></td><td>The date on which this issue is to&nbsp;be&nbsp;started</td></tr><tr><td>endDate</td><td>date</td><td><br></td><td>The due date of this issue</td></tr><tr><td>typeId</td><td>Issuetype</td><td>36</td><td>The identifier of the issue type of this issue</td></tr><tr><td>priority</td><td>Text</td><td>15</td><td>The priority of the issue</td></tr><tr><td>status</td><td>Text</td><td>15</td><td>The status of the issue</td></tr><tr><td>assignee</td><td>User</td><td>36</td><td>The user to whom this issue is assigned</td></tr><tr><td>owner</td><td>User</td><td>36</td><td>The owner of this issue</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><p><br></p>','79be2d815aee-9787-4779-35bb2c04b35a'),('b4a59ab6583c-b7cd-29ed-04a99d097430','Test 13','2016-11-28 02:45:08','2016-11-28 02:45:08','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>Test 13</p>','21844680583c-b7cd-29ed-f0fac6d6ca7e'),('bfcc7060585c-c6f1-5273-c263be13b58e','Wiki','2016-12-22 11:51:27','2016-12-22 11:51:27','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>This page is for the wiki entries</p>','a607e2215835-b8f6-bf45-62703a8a48f8'),('c031e0705846-4cc4-bca2-9608c281d375','Hi3','2016-12-06 04:06:24','2016-12-06 04:06:24','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>Hi</p><p><br></p><p>no it is not you that I was looking for. Of Course.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Hello World Logo uï»¿r self</strong></p>','3368f0a85837-8a9d-1d53-9248760c275a'),('c20c75315837-73da-1d53-e27835fa8268','Test update take 3','2016-11-24 10:13:22','2016-11-24 10:13:22','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>This is a test for the title update, this should not <strong>refresh</strong></p><p><br></p>',NULL),('d247ef015a30-b306-b9b8-5fd5e2cab9e3','Summernote Page','2017-12-12 10:11:30','2017-12-12 10:11:30','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'645','<p>This is a summer note page <span class=\"atwho-query\">:</span></p><blockquote><p>Banzai</p></blockquote><p>With tables</p><table class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width: 1335px;\"><tbody><tr><td>Issue</td><td>Status</td><td>Assigned To</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"atwho-inserted\" data-atwho-at-query=\"#\" contenteditable=\"false\"><a href=\"/app/645/issues/1271\" class=\"complete\">#1262 - non,</a></span>&nbsp;</td><td>Closed</td><td><span class=\"atwho-inserted\" data-atwho-at-query=\"@\" contenteditable=\"false\"><a href=\"/app/users/18\" class=\"undefined\">@Castor Howell</a></span>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"atwho-inserted\" data-atwho-at-query=\"#\" contenteditable=\"false\"><a href=\"/app/645/issues/795\" class=\"complete\">#786 - elit</a></span>&nbsp;</td><td>Closed</td><td><span class=\"atwho-inserted\" data-atwho-at-query=\"@\" contenteditable=\"false\"><a href=\"/app/users/12\" class=\"undefined\">@Adam Holt</a></span>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"atwho-inserted\" data-atwho-at-query=\"#\" contenteditable=\"false\"><a href=\"/app/645/issues/bab97b885970-87cc-3080-f99aa042f8ef\" class=\"new\">#3001 - Test 1</a></span>&nbsp;</td><td>Pending</td><td>@</td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p>What say you <span class=\"atwho-inserted\" data-atwho-at-query=\"@\" contenteditable=\"false\"><a href=\"/app/users/12\" class=\"undefined\">@Adam Holt</a></span>&nbsp;, we can now close your <b>infernal</b> <span class=\"\"><span class=\"atwho-inserted\" data-atwho-at-query=\"#\" contenteditable=\"false\"><a href=\"/app/645/issues/795\" class=\"complete\">#786 - elit</a></span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span class=\"\"><br></span></p>',NULL),('d419d4735846-6d9e-d993-87296d0e4b1e','Home','2016-12-06 04:40:52','2016-12-06 04:40:52','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'490','<p>This is good</p>',NULL),('d6694732583d-a500-dc60-5a3013ff6990','Overflow Scrolling','2016-11-29 05:08:38','2016-11-29 05:08:38','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<h3><u>Introduction</u></h3><p><br></p><p>In order to achieve appropriate scrolling the following structure must be implemented</p><p><br></p><pre spellcheck=\"false\">&lt;style&gt;\n	.container{\n		height:100%;\n		width:100%;\n		position:relative;\n		overflow:hidden;\n	}\n	.contents{\n		height:100%;\n		width:100%;\n		position:absolute;\n		overflow:auto;\n	}\n&lt;/style&gt;\n\n&lt;div class=\"container\"&gt;\n	&lt;div class=\"contents\"&gt;\n		This would be scroll-able content.\n	&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n</pre><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 204, 204);\">Note: It is important to note that the container is not optional, it is a must and without the relative container there is no way for the contents to know the bounds required for scrolling</span></p>',NULL),('d689e622588d-5fb4-0b4c-119ba0419972','Security Cameras','2017-01-28 21:00:06','2017-01-28 21:00:06','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'244','<h2>Security Cameras</h2><p><br></p><p>We need to have 110% coverage! with 6 months backup</p><p><br></p><p>Storage <span class=\"atwho-inserted\" data-atwho-at-query=\"#\" contenteditable=\"false\"><a href=\"/app/244/issues/794\" class=\"pending\">#785 - Lorem ipsum</a></span>&nbsp;</p><p>Server Rack. <span class=\"atwho-inserted\" data-atwho-at-query=\"@\" contenteditable=\"false\"><a href=\"/app/users/1\" class=\"undefined\">@Hammad Hassan</a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>','377b3241588d-5fb4-5278-f4a6c72ae03b'),('e6518a605837-bc3f-9acb-95e557f6d093','Test','2016-11-24 10:39:34','2016-11-24 10:39:34','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'645','<p>This is another test page</p>',NULL),('f9c68291588d-c44f-5278-9266d7264ba6','Home','2017-01-28 20:56:25','2017-01-28 20:56:25','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'244','<h2 class=\"ql-align-center\">Primis Inc.</h2><p><br></p><p>The company is looking for the state of the art security infrastructure. The company create ERP software and has been in business for more than 20 years. They have big customer in their portfolio but now they have to work with a government to provide the Punjab assembly with the ERP solution. Although they have good security measures but now they need to be on the next level and must have level 10 clearance before they can even connect to the government infrastructure.</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Requirements</u></strong></p><ul><li>Security Camera</li><li>Data Servers</li><li>Audit</li><li>Access Controls</li><li>Intrusion Detection</li><li>Intrusion Prevention</li><li>Body scanner</li><li>Locks</li><li>Bolts</li><li>Locker room</li><li>Firewalls</li><li>Power generators</li><li>UPS</li><li>Backup batteries</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Budget :</u></strong> $25,000,000</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Timeline :</u></strong> 2 months</p><p><br></p><p><strong><u>Challenges</u></strong></p><ul><li>Detailed documentation required</li><li>Extended support required</li><li>Man power</li><li>Equipment stock</li></ul><p><br></p>',NULL),('ffd27fa8585c-328c-d95e-9ade69d1a276','Test 10','2016-12-22 12:05:19','2016-12-22 12:05:19','1','Hammad Hassan','1','Hammad Hassan',0,'published',0,1,'1','<p>Test 10</p>','a607e2215835-b8f6-bf45-62703a8a48f8');
